{"id":"939ca22d34f396a7","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Normal Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree — ZFC Tree10 Normal Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree","58-df-zfc-tree8-normal-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree — ZFC Tree10 Normal Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree</span><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-normal-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree — ZFC Tree10 Normal Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"15016c1e1dd46781\" href=\"?note=15016c1e1dd46781\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree\">58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,t,u,\\alpha,\\beta,L_0,L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\\in V\">\\(T,t,u,\\alpha,\\beta,L_0,L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\">\\(\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\)</span> (locally quantified extension-order witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (tree-order predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (level predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8NormalTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8NormalTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}normal\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land\\exists L_0\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,0,L_0)\\land\\exists r\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\in L_0\\leftrightarrow t=r)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\;\\forall L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\beta,L_\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\land L_\\beta\\neq\\varnothing\\rightarrow\\forall t\\in L_\\alpha\\;\\exists u\\in L_\\beta\\;(\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\sqsubseteq_T)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}normal\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land\\exists L_0\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,0,L_0)\\land\\exists r\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\in L_0\\leftrightarrow t=r)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\;\\forall L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\beta,L_\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\land L_\\beta\\neq\\varnothing\\rightarrow\\forall t\\in L_\\alpha\\;\\exists u\\in L_\\beta\\;(\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\sqsubseteq_T)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}normal\\text{-}tree\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8NormalTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}normal\\text{-}tree\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8NormalTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Normality includes a unique root and extension of every node to every higher nonempty level.</li>\n<li>Levels are supplied by the canonical order-type definition, so the predicate applies to the validated tree order without assuming an undeclared sequence-length operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree","status":"resolved","id":"15016c1e1dd46781","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,t,u,\\alpha,\\beta,L_0,L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8NormalTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}normal\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land\\exists L_0\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,0,L_0)\\land\\exists r\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;(t\\in L_0\\leftrightarrow t=r)\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\;\\forall L_\\alpha,L_\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\alpha,L_\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T,\\beta,L_\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\land L_\\beta\\neq\\varnothing\\rightarrow\\forall t\\in L_\\alpha\\;\\exists u\\in L_\\beta\\;(\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\sqsubseteq_T)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}normal\\text{-}tree\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8NormalTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree10NormalTree}_S(T)","display":true}],"bytes":2006,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3769","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-normal-tree]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","15016c1e1dd46781"]}